This product includes selected OpenAIDR source from the public commit
7ec2891b0904dad621bb13f24312121d05d4ca03 under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
The upstream license is retained at vendor/openaidr/LICENSE.

The native Claude launcher uses the unmodified public response formatter in
src/openaidr/guardrail/{__init__,hooks}.py.

Tidewall modified src/openaidr/__init__.py to resolve version and provenance
from the Tidewall package and src/openaidr/sensor/collectors.py to retain only
the Claude parser, remove host/path and fallback fields, and require an
explicit stream. The parser preserves valid sibling observations when a
tool-use block is malformed. Paths are relative to the OpenAIDR extraction root.

Tidewall modified src/openaidr/sensor/spool.py to bound segment and record
sizes, fsync positioned JSONL appends, recover partial writes and preserve
unread segments under the enrollment journal's capacity and cursor rules.
It reclaims retired prefixes with a journaled in-place copy and file fsync.
